Turn into a wraith, allowing you to walk through walls and removing the need to breath for [3, 5, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns.

Also increases your defense and armour by [5, 10, 13, 17, 20 (TL1-5)] and [5, 8, 11, 13, 16 (TL1-5)], respectively.

If you are still in a wall when the effect ends you will randomly teleport.
